{"id": 1, "ok": true, "cmd": "ucas", "ucas": "q(x: i32, y: i32) = x / y\nq0(x: i32, y: i32) = y == 0 ? 7 : x / y\nwiden(v: u32, n: u32 in 5..8) = n == 8 ? v : ((v << (8 - n)) | (v >> (2*n - 8))) & 0xFF where v < 1 << n\nwiden2(v: u32, n: u32 in 5..8) = ((v << (8 - n)) | (v >> (2*n - 8))) & 0xFF where v < 1 << n", "structured": false, "result": {"text": "> q(x: i32, y: i32) = x / y\n> q0(x: i32, y: i32) = y == 0 ? 7 : x / y\n> widen(v: u32, n: u32 in 5..8) = n == 8 ? v : ((v << (8 - n)) | (v >> (2*n - 8))) & 0xFF where v < 1 << n\n> widen2(v: u32, n: u32 in 5..8) = ((v << (8 - n)) | (v >> (2*n - 8))) & 0xFF where v < 1 << n\n"}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "> q(x: i32, y: i32) = x / y\n> q0(x: i32, y: i32) = y == 0 ? 7 : x / y\n> widen(v: u32, n: u32 in 5..8) = n == 8 ? v : ((v << (8 - n)) | (v >> (2*n - 8))) & 0xFF where v < 1 << n\n> widen2(v: u32, n: u32 in 5..8) = ((v << (8 - n)) | (v >> (2*n - 8))) & 0xFF where v < 1 << n\n"}
