{"id": 5, "ok": true, "cmd": "find", "ucas": "cl(x: u8, s: u8 in 0..3) = min(max(u32(x) >> s, 0), 255) & 0xFF\nfind cl 1", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "find", "points": 1024, "sampled": false, "type": "u32", "model": "gt1030", "peephole": [{"cost": 4, "expr": "min(max(u32(x) >> s, 0), 255)", "drops": "& 255", "proof": "exhaustive"}, {"cost": 4, "expr": "max(u32(x) >> s, 0) & 0xff", "drops": "min with 255", "proof": "exhaustive"}, {"cost": 4, "expr": "min(u32(x) >> s, 255) & 0xff", "drops": "max with 0", "proof": "exhaustive"}], "peephole_fixpoint": {"cost": 2, "expr": "u32(x) >> s", "drops": "& 255, then min with 255, then max with 0", "proof": "exhaustive"}, "parametric": [{"cost": 7, "cost_per_use": 5, "expr": "u32(x)*(8 >> u32(s)) >> 3", "K": "8 >> u32(s)", "why": "K = 8 >> u32(s) (a constant shifted by the case) depends only on s: compute it once where s is set", "proof": "exhaustive"}, {"cost": 17, "cost_per_use": 5, "expr": "u32(x)*(u32(s) == 0 ? 8 : u32(s) == 1 ? 4 : u32(s) == 2 ? 2 : 1) >> 3", "K": "u32(s) == 0 ? 8 : u32(s) == 1 ? 4 : u32(s) == 2 ? 2 : 1", "why": "K = u32(s) == 0 ? 8 : u32(s) == 1 ? 4 : u32(s) == 2 ? 2 : 1 (one constant per case) depends only on s: compute it once where s is set", "proof": "exhaustive"}], "implementations": [{"cost": 2, "expr": "u32(x) >> u32(s)", "why": "exact", "verified": true, "exhaustive": true, "proof": "exhaustive"}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "find cl: 1024 points, computing in u32, costs from gt1030\n  dropping operations of cl (cost 5 as written; each checked on the whole domain):\n  cost 4   min(max(u32(x) >> s, 0), 255)            drops & 255 (exhaustive)\n  cost 4   max(u32(x) >> s, 0) & 0xff               drops min with 255 (exhaustive)\n  cost 4   min(u32(x) >> s, 255) & 0xff             drops max with 0 (exhaustive)\n  cost 2   u32(x) >> s                              all of them: drops & 255, then min with 255, then max with 0 (exhaustive)\n  split on s (4 values), fitted (x*K + C) >> S per case: S = 3, C = 0\n  cost 7   u32(x)*(8 >> u32(s)) >> 3\n           K = 8 >> u32(s) (a constant shifted by the case) depends only on s: compute it once where s is set; 5 per use once K is known (exhaustive)\n  cost 17  u32(x)*(u32(s) == 0 ? 8 : u32(s) == 1 ? 4 : u32(s) == 2 ? 2 : 1) >> 3\n           K = u32(s) == 0 ? 8 : u32(s) == 1 ? 4 : u32(s) == 2 ? 2 : 1 (one constant per case) depends only on s: compute it once where s is set; 5 per use once K is known (exhaustive)\n  cost 2   u32(x) >> u32(s)                         exact\n  [searched every term up to cost 2: 2059 distinct columns; 'more' continues]\n"}
{"id": 6, "ok": true, "cmd": "ucas", "ucas": "quant(v: i32 in 0..255) = { best = 0; berr = 100000; q0 = (v * 31 + 127) / 255; for d in -2..2 { q = q0 + d; qc = q < 0 ? 0 : q > 31 ? 31 : q; r = (qc << 3) | (qc >> 2); e = (r - v) * (r - v); if e < berr { berr = e; best = qc } }; best }", "structured": false, "result": {"text": ""}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": ""}
{"id": 7, "ok": true, "cmd": "cost", "ucas": "cost quant", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "cost", "shared": "q = int((31v + 127)/255) + d\nqc = q < 0 ? 0 : q > 31 ? 31 : q\nt1 = (qc << 3 | qc >> 2) - int(v)\nt2 = t1*t1 < berr", "model": "gt1030", "total": 190.25, "operations": 0, "by_class": [{"class": "iadd", "count": 15, "each": 1, "cost": 15}, {"class": "logic", "count": 5, "each": 1, "cost": 5}, {"class": "shift", "count": 10, "each": 2, "cost": 20}, {"class": "imul", "count": 5, "each": 3, "cost": 15}, {"class": "cmp", "count": 20, "each": 2.375, "cost": 47.5}, {"class": "select", "count": 20, "each": 1.625, "cost": 32.5}, {"class": "branch", "count": 5, "each": 6.25, "cost": 31.25}, {"class": "sdivk", "count": 1, "each": 21, "cost": 21}], "fusions": [{"fusion": "imad", "pattern": "a*b + c", "count": 1, "cost": 3, "saved": 1}], "loops": [{"loop": "d in -2..2", "body": 23.625, "overhead": 9.625, "once": 24, "trips_worst": 5, "trips_average": 5, "trips_known": true, "trips_bound_sound": true, "total_worst": 190.25, "total_average": 190.25}], "selects": [{"condition": "q > 31", "select": 1.625, "uniform_branch": 6.25, "divergent_branch": 20.625, "uniform_condition": false, "best": "select", "in_loop": true}, {"condition": "q < 0", "select": 1.625, "uniform_branch": 6.25, "divergent_branch": 20.625, "uniform_condition": false, "best": "select", "in_loop": true}, {"condition": "t1*t1 < berr", "select": 1.625, "uniform_branch": 6.25, "divergent_branch": 20.625, "uniform_condition": false, "best": "select", "in_loop": true}, {"condition": "t1*t1 < berr", "select": 1.625, "uniform_branch": 6.25, "divergent_branch": 20.625, "uniform_condition": false, "best": "select", "in_loop": true}], "best_total": 190.25}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "files": [], "text": "cost of quant under gt1030: 190.25 (0 operations outside loops and 1 loop, shared subterms counted once)\n  shared subterms (named once, used below):\n    q = int((31v + 127)/255) + d\n    qc = q < 0 ? 0 : q > 31 ? 31 : q\n    t1 = (qc << 3 | qc >> 2) - int(v)\n    t2 = t1*t1 < berr\n  iadd            15 x 1     = 15\n  logic            5 x 1     = 5\n  shift           10 x 2     = 20\n  imul             5 x 3     = 15\n  cmp             20 x 2.375 = 47.5\n  select          20 x 1.625 = 32.5\n  branch           5 x 6.25  = 31.25\n  sdivk            1 x 21    = 21\n  fused by the model (one instruction for several operations):\n    imad             1 x 3     = 3  (a*b + c; saves 1)\n  loop d in -2..2:\n    per iteration: body 23.625 + overhead 9.625 (index add, compare, branch) = 33.25\n    trip count: 5 (constant bounds)\n    once: 24 (initial values and loop-invariant subterms, hoisted)\n    loop total: 190.25\n  ?: on q > 31  (arms cost 0 and 0)  [in a loop body: per iteration]\n      select: +1.625   uniform branch: +6.25   divergent branch: +20.625\n      -> select (condition varies per invocation; mark parameters 'uniform' if it does not)\n  ?: on q < 0  (arms cost 0 and 4)  [in a loop body: per iteration]\n      select: +1.625   uniform branch: +6.25   divergent branch: +20.625\n      -> select (condition varies per invocation; mark parameters 'uniform' if it does not)\n  ?: on t1*t1 < berr  (arms cost 0 and 0)  [in a loop body: per iteration]\n      select: +1.625   uniform branch: +6.25   divergent branch: +20.625\n      -> select (condition varies per invocation; mark parameters 'uniform' if it does not)\n  ?: on t1*t1 < berr  (arms cost 0 and 0)  [in a loop body: per iteration]\n      select: +1.625   uniform branch: +6.25   divergent branch: +20.625\n      -> select (condition varies per invocation; mark parameters 'uniform' if it does not)\n  estimate with the best form per ?: : 190.25\n"}
